    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404-a24">

                <pb facs="0646" n="576" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg576"/>

                <head>No. 24.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—From <placeName>San Luis
                            Potosi</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-03">June 3,
                            1867</date>, at 10.15 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mariano Escobedo</hi> ;</p>
                <p>In order to decide upon the messages received last night in relation to Baron
                    Magnus, the President wishes to know if the message of the baron was sent
                    yesterday or before, and from what place. Do you know if he is waiting for the
                    answer, or is he on the road, and where is he to be found at present ? and if
                    the term for Maximilian’s defence, which you said would begin to run at 4 or 5
                    in the afternoon, is the first term allowed by the law, or is it a second term
                    by virtue of a legal extension?</p>
                <p>I will wait for your answer, so that the President may decide.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. LERDO DE TEJADA.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
